10 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
11 REM KEYTEST - ETAP 0: WHAT DOES INKEY$ RETURN ON THIS MACHINE
12 REM PRESS KEYS, THE CODE OF EACH ONE IS PRINTED. PRESS 0 TO STOP.
13 REM WRITE THE CODES INTO THE KEY TABLE AT LINE 10500 OF TETRIS.BAS
14 REM AND INTO DOCS/UKNC_BASIC_NOTES.MD.
15 REM ---------------------------------------------------------------
20 SCREEN 0
30 CLS
40 PRINT "PRESS A KEY, 0 TO STOP"
50 KB$=INKEY$
60 IF KB$="" THEN GOTO 50
70 KC%=ASC(KB$)
80 PRINT "CODE";KC%
90 IF KC%=48 THEN GOTO 110
100 GOTO 50
110 PRINT "DONE"
120 END
